{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂浪漫見てますか？私は毎晩見てます！\nみんなすごいきれいだし、素敵な映像ですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3988657/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思わず見とれちゃう(・∀・*)ゞ\n自分の回も大丈夫かな〜って気になります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3988657/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶん私は来週か再来週くらいに出ると思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3988657/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっきりしなくてすみません・・・\n見て下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3988657/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと2ndシングルの33人ＰＶ\nダイジェスト版が公式チャンネル公開されました☆\n私は観覧車〜♪\nいつも通りのびのびした感じだと思います。笑\n普段のしゃべりっぽく（*^_^*）\n観覧車は乗ったのすごく久しぶりで楽しかった〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3988657/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に乗ったつもりでLet's go!! o(^-^)o ワクワク"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の写メはみなみと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3988657/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このあいだ撮影したヤンマガの衣装ですっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/06/3988657/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから\n4/７名古屋の全国握手会、\n学校行事により欠席することになりました。\n本当に申し訳ありません。\nまた次の機会にお会いできたらうれしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}